del token breakdown in usage reports\",\n    \"description\": \"Enhanced usage reporting now provides detailed token usage breakdown by model, helping teams track and optimize their Copilot usage across different AI models.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-08-11-per-model-token-breakdown-in-the-usage-report\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-11\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Copilot CLI v1.0.80 with model configuration updates\",\n    \"description\": \"GitHub Copilot CLI v1.0.80 released with updated model configurations, enterprise policy support, and improved sandbox settings transparency.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/github/copilot-cli/blob/main/changelog.md\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-14\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Copilot CLI v1.0.79 with enterprise policy support\",\n    \"description\": \"Version 1.0.79 adds enterprise allow-auto-only policy enforcement, proxy URL configuration with user-controlled credentials, model picker improvements, and tgrep for faster large codebase searching.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/github/copilot-cli/blob/main/changelog.md\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-10\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Weekly releases - App, CLI, and VS Code improvements\",\n    \"description\": \"GitHub Copilot App now shows which model handled each request with AI credit details. Copilot CLI adds Sessions sidebar, experimental /worktree command, and /rewind without Git. VS Code 1.132 includes integrated browser with element-level feedback and /btw side questions.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-08-07-github-copilot-weekly-releases-august-3\",\n    \"d